{
  "resourceType": "Questionnaire",
  "id": "chemical-use-history",
  "url": "https://fhir.slade360.co.ke/fhir/Questionnaire/chemical-use-history",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "name": "ChemicalUseHistory",
  "title": "Chemical Use History",
  "status": "draft",
  "subjectType": [
    "Patient"
  ],
  "date": "2026-09-18",
  "description": "Self-reflective assessment of how chemical use has affected the client's life: thirty-three narrative questions covering first use, patterns, consequences, tolerance and withdrawal, and reasons for seeking treatment.",
  "extension": [
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-targetStructureMap",
      "valueCanonical": "https://fhir.slade360.co.ke/fhir/StructureMap/ExtractChemicalUseHistory"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "linkId": "intro",
      "type": "display",
      "text": "This exercise will help you become more aware of how chemicals have affected your life and the lives of those around you. Using alcohol or any other mood-altering substance counts as chemical use. Answer as honestly as you can, and write down what happened."
    },
    {
      "linkId": "client",
      "type": "group",
      "text": "Client",
      "item": [
        {
          "linkId": "client.name",
          "type": "string",
          "text": "Name",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "linkId": "client.admissionNumber",
          "type": "string",
          "text": "Admission number",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "linkId": "client.date",
          "type": "date",
          "text": "Date completed",
          "required": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "linkId": "history",
      "type": "group",
      "text": "Chemical use history",
      "item": [
        {
          "linkId": "history.firstDrink",
          "prefix": "1",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "How old were you when you had your first drink? Describe what happened and how you felt.",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.drugsUsed",
          "prefix": "2",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "List all of the drugs you have ever used, and the age at which you first used each one.",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.habits",
          "prefix": "3",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "What are your drug-using habits? Where do you use? With whom? Under what circumstances?",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.heavyPeriod",
          "prefix": "4",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Was there ever a period in your life when you used too much or too often? Explain.",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.problemsCaused",
          "prefix": "5",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Has using chemicals ever caused a problem for you? Describe the problem or problems.",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.moreThanIntended",
          "prefix": "6",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "When you were using, did you find that you used more, or for longer, than you had originally intended? Give some examples.",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.tolerance",
          "prefix": "7",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Do you have to use more of the chemical now to get the same effect? How much more than when you first started?",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.cuttingDown",
          "prefix": "8",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Did you ever try to cut down, and what happened to your attempt?",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.cuttingDownHow",
          "prefix": "9",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "What did you do to cut down? Did you change your beverage, limit the amount, or restrict your use to a certain time of day?",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.stoppedCompletely",
          "prefix": "10",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Did you ever stop using completely? What happened? Why did you start again?",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.timeIntoxicated",
          "prefix": "11",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Did you spend a lot of time intoxicated or hung over?",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.dangerousUse",
          "prefix": "12",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Did you ever use while doing something dangerous, such as driving a car? Give some examples.",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.missedWork",
          "prefix": "13",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Were you ever so high, or so hung over, that you missed work or school? Give some examples.",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.missedFamilyEvents",
          "prefix": "14",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Did you ever miss family events because you were high or hung over? Give a few examples.",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.familyProblems",
          "prefix": "15",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Did you ever cause family problems? Give examples.",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.annoyedWhenChallenged",
          "prefix": "16",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Did you ever feel annoyed when someone talked to you about your drinking or drug use? Who was it, and what did they say?",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.guilt",
          "prefix": "17",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Did you ever feel bad or guilty about your use? Give examples.",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.psychologicalProblems",
          "prefix": "18",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Did using ever cause you psychological problems, such as being depressed? Explain the problem, with examples.",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.physicalProblems",
          "prefix": "19",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Did using ever cause physical problems, or make a physical problem worse? Give a few examples.",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.blackouts",
          "prefix": "20",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Did you ever have a blackout? How old were you when you had your first one? Give some examples.",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.sickFromUse",
          "prefix": "21",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Did you ever get sick because you were too intoxicated? Give some examples.",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.badHangovers",
          "prefix": "22",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Did you ever have a really bad hangover? Describe how you felt.",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.withdrawal",
          "prefix": "23",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Did you ever get the shakes or suffer withdrawal symptoms when you quit using? Describe what happened when you stopped.",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.useToAvoidWithdrawal",
          "prefix": "24",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Did you ever use to avoid withdrawal symptoms? Give examples of when you used a substance to control them.",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.previousHelp",
          "prefix": "25",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Have you ever sought help for your drug problem? When? Who did you see? Did the treatment help, and how?",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.reasonsToContinue",
          "prefix": "26",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Why do you want to continue to use? Give five reasons.",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.reasonsToStop",
          "prefix": "27",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Why do you want to stop using? Give ten reasons.",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.reputation",
          "prefix": "28",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Has alcohol or drug use ever affected your reputation? Describe what happened and how you felt, and how you feel about yourself now.",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.financialImpact",
          "prefix": "29",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "How has using affected you financially? Give a few examples of money wasted in your addiction.",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.selfImage",
          "prefix": "30",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Has your addiction changed how you feel about yourself? Give some examples.",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.ambition",
          "prefix": "31",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Has your ambition decreased since you started using? Give some examples.",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.selfConfidence",
          "prefix": "32",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Are you as self-confident as you were before?",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "linkId": "history.whyTreatmentNow",
          "prefix": "33",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Describe the reasons why you want treatment now.",
          "code": [
            {
              "system": "http://loinc.org",
              "code": "34109-9",
              "display": "Note"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "publisher": "Savannah Global Health Institute (SGHI)",
  "contact": [
